description:
The in-repo rename (benchbox-residual-oracle-names-20261106) deliberately keeps these infrastructure names as documented legacy names:
- the GitHub environment `oracle`;
- its ORACLE_* secrets, which the callers map to REVIEW_*;
- the tailnet tag `tag:oracle-ci` with its ACL;
- the `benchbox-oracle` App name.
Renaming them needs owner work: a new `review` environment with the secrets re-entered, a new tag plus ACL and OAuth client, and possibly an App rename. The caller and tag changes must land in the same PR as the cutover.
